    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hey,<div>I&#39;m a new to R so bear with me please. I would like to know if there is a straightforward way to draw a plot ala the plot that I have attached. I know how to plot this plot using the plot() function in R, but I want to plot it using the ggplot2 package specifically (i need to do some more modifications afterwards and use some of the features of ggplot2). Do any of you know how I can do it easily or simply how I can do it? Apologies if the question seems stupid.</div><div>best regards</div><div>Henrik</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
